# Records the README demo GIF from a live server run against a fictional
# database. Regenerate with: npm run demo
# The player script (scripts/demo-transcript.mjs) does the actual typing
# and prints only real tool call results; vhs just captures the terminal.

Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 900
Set Height 560
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 0

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "node scripts/demo-transcript.mjs"
Enter
Sleep 14s
